melody:
# Chorus (as printed in the 1892 sheet music)
Dai-sy, Dai-sy, give me your an-swer, do!
D5(3) B4(3) G4(3) D4(3) E4 F#4 G4 E4(2) G4 D4(3) ~D4(2) r
I'm half cra-zy, all for the love of you! It
A4(3) D5(3) B4(3) G4(3) E4 F#4 G4 A4(2) B4 A4(3) ~A4(2) B4
won't be a styl-ish mar-riage, I can't af-ford a car-riage, But
C5 B4 A4 D5(2) B4 A4 G4(2) ~G4(2) A4 B4(2) G4 E4(2) G4 E4 D4(2) ~D4(2) D4
you'll look sweet on the seat of a bi-cy-cle built for two!
